From 28fb78413996372a56bbac796de11d22d7741e5c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 2 Sep 2026 15:44:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Commit the lockfile, ignore patch and holding-pen folders
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

package-lock.json was untracked, so `npm install` resolved @playwright/test
fresh on every machine. The repo asks for ^1.49.0 and currently resolves to
1.62.1, which expects a different bundled browser build — a test run can fail
for no reason other than when it was set up. Pinning it makes the suite
reproducible, which matters here because tests/site.spec.js is the most
reliable memory in this project.

Also ignoring two folders that only exist to move work between machines:

- patches/ holds format-patch output. It is transport, not source.
- _to_delete/ holds files the sandbox could not remove, because the mounted
  folder forbids unlink. It currently contains two stale .git/index.lock
  files that were blocking git. Delete the folder in Finder; it should never
  be versioned.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012Uz6js2Gvt177WmPyzMien
---
 .gitignore        |  7 +++++
 package-lock.json | 76 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 83 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 package-lock.json

diff --git a/.gitignore b/.gitignore
index d73d381..72ae7be 100644
--- a/.gitignore
+++ b/.gitignore
@@ -28,3 +28,10 @@ test-results/
 playwright-report/
 blob-report/
 playwright/.cache/
+
+# Patch files used to move commits between machines. Transport, not source.
+patches/
+
+# Holding pen for files the sandbox could not delete directly (the mount
+# forbids unlink). Delete this folder in Finder; it should never be versioned.
+_to_delete/
diff --git a/package-lock.json b/package-lock.json
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..6eda0e5
--- /dev/null
+++ b/package-lock.json
@@ -0,0 +1,76 @@
